  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "alone 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握其用法，及比较与 lonely 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "alone"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 用作形容词时，意为“独自的，单独的”，只能用作表语，不能用作定语。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：I was "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "alone"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " in the house. 我一个人在家。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "注意：alone 也可用作副词，意为“单独地，独自地”，不含感情色彩。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：He lives "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "alone"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". 他单独居住。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "lonely"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 虽以 -ly 结尾，但它是形容词而不是副词。它可以用作表语，意为“寂寞的”，多指人，也可用作定语，意为“荒凉的”，多指地方。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：He doesn’t feel "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "lonely"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " when he is left alone. 他单独留下时并不感到寂寞。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "He was taken to a "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "lonely"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " island. 他被带到一个荒岛上。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
